PROBE 1 - the lfsu rows at +0xc60 and +0x1ab0, which v1 left as its named untried lever. Source is the j<3 light loop at L486-491. Applied the block-scope-cursor cure verbatim:
                         for (j = 0; j < 3; j++) {
+                            f32* ld;
                             q = p + j * 4;
                             WSWAPF(q, offsetof(level_data, lightcolor_fp));
-                            q += offsetof(level_data, lightdir);
-                            *(f32*)q = WorldSwapF(*(f32*)q);
+                            ld = (f32*)(q + offsetof(level_data, lightdir));
+                            *ld = WorldSwapF(*ld);
